{"2345430": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Escape From Crimson Manor: Trapped Together", "steam_appid": 2345430, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ESCAPE FROM CRIMSON MANOR: TRAPPED TOGETHER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two minds, one escape. The ultimate cooperative puzzle experience.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape from Crimson Manor: Trapped Together is above all a test of communication and deduction. Set in an interconnected Victorian manor, this game brings the intricate puzzle design of The Inheritance of Crimson Manor to a dedicated two-player experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🗝️ <strong>THE MAIN EVENT</strong>: Cooperative Puzzle Campaign (2 Players) &quot;Trapped Together&quot;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for those who value logic over panic. In this full narrative campaign, you cannot die. There is no monster chasing you; only the manor itself stands in your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Separated but Connected: Wake up in opposite wings of the manor. You cannot see what your partner sees; voice communication is your only tool.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Pure Deduction: Without the threat of death, take your time to solve complex mechanical puzzles and decipher cryptic riddles in a stress-free environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Exchange Mechanics: One player has the recipe, the other the ingredients. Master the dumbwaiter system to exchange tools, keys, and crucial clues between floors to advance together.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🩸 COMING SOON - FREE UPDATE BONUS MODE: </strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Asymmetrical Survival (3v1) </strong>&quot;The Blood Harvest&quot; [<strong>AVAILABLE Q3 2026</strong>]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Looking for adrenaline after the puzzles? Change the pace in this highly replayable, high-stakes mode where survival is not guaranteed.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Alchemist vs. Survivors: One player becomes the obsessed Alchemist, hunting down up to three Survivors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Hunt: Unlike the main campaign, death is real here. The Alchemist uses the dumbwaiters to ambush victims and drain their essence to become younger and faster.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Escape: Survivors must use stealth and sabotage to locate blood vials and break the lockdown before they</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ESCAPE FROM CRIMSON MANOR: TRAPPED TOGETHER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two minds, one escape. The ultimate cooperative puzzle experience.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape from Crimson Manor: Trapped Together is above all a test of communication and deduction. Set in an interconnected Victorian manor, this game brings the intricate puzzle design of The Inheritance of Crimson Manor to a dedicated two-player experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🗝️ <strong>THE MAIN EVENT</strong>: Cooperative Puzzle Campaign (2 Players) &quot;Trapped Together&quot;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for those who value logic over panic. In this full narrative campaign, you cannot die. There is no monster chasing you; only the manor itself stands in your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Separated but Connected: Wake up in opposite wings of the manor. You cannot see what your partner sees; voice communication is your only tool.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Pure Deduction: Without the threat of death, take your time to solve complex mechanical puzzles and decipher cryptic riddles in a stress-free environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Exchange Mechanics: One player has the recipe, the other the ingredients. Master the dumbwaiter system to exchange tools, keys, and crucial clues between floors to advance together.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🩸 COMING SOON - FREE UPDATE BONUS MODE: </strong><